source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: Jira renders the line below a heading item as a second block inside the item. JFM has no such item, so jiro keeps the heading in the item and writes the paragraph after the list.
-- input.jira --
* h1. y
z
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li><h1><a name="y"></a>y</h1>
<p>z</p></li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- # y

z
-- warnings.json --
[]
